00:50.446 --> 00:53.227
And each of their heights,
let's see the interval,

00:53.227 --> 00:55.595
it looks like they each
have a width of two,

00:55.595 --> 00:58.713
so they are equally spaced,
so we go from zero to eight,

00:58.713 --> 01:02.845
and we split into four sections,
so each has a width of two,

01:02.845 --> 01:04.695
