01:04.695 --> 01:07.928
so that's two, that's two,
that's two, that's two.

01:07.928 --> 01:14.327
And their height seems to
be based on the midpoint,

01:14.327 --> 01:16.179
so between the start,
between the left side

01:16.179 --> 01:17.827
and the right side of the rectangle,

01:17.827 --> 01:20.728
you take the value of the
